  m_text: "Controls: \nWASD -> move, Space -> jump, LShift -> dash, \nLCtrl -> slide,
    LMouseClick -> shoot\n\nObjective:\nCorrectly paint as much of the map as possible
    within the time limit.\n\nThings to Know:\nEnemies will explode when close enough
    to you for too long. \nYou can see the colour/number you need to shoot in the
    top centre of your UI.\nThe percentage of the map you paint correctly determines
    whether your energy bar drains; fall below 50% correct and it will go down,\nit
    wont go back up until the percentage is back above 75%."
